---
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>Video Marketing Strategy | Mitchell Haw</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Video marketing strategy for YouTube, short-form video, SEO visibility, AI search visibility, and content discovery." />
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main>
      <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <p class="section-label">Video Marketing</p>
          <h1>Video content that supports search, discovery, and brand visibility.</h1>
          <p>
            I help businesses use YouTube, short-form video, and search-friendly video content
            to reach more people across Google, social platforms, and AI search.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="services">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="service-grid three">
            <div class="card">
              <h3>YouTube Strategy</h3>
              <p>Topic planning, titles, descriptions, playlists, video SEO, and content ideas built around real search demand.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <h3>Short-Form Video</h3>
              <p>Simple video ideas for Instagram, TikTok, YouTube Shorts, and social discovery without overcomplicating production.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
              <h3>Search & AI Support</h3>
              <p>Use video to strengthen brand signals, answer common questions, and support visibility in Google and AI results.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="intro">
        <div class="container narrow">
          <h2>Video is becoming part of search strategy.</h2>
          <p>
            Google, YouTube, social platforms, and AI systems all use video content as a discovery signal.
            The right video strategy can support SEO, brand trust, and customer education.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="primary-btn">Reach Out</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
